<!doctype html>
<!--
  The Long Walk.

  A path with plots down either side of it, and in each plot the plants that
  two people grew when they met. It runs away from the reader; walking on goes
  further down it, and turning goes round to another side of the same plots.

  **This page is the one the app talks to, not a picture of it.** The plants
  are grown here, in the browser, from the same SeedCore that grows them on the
  phone — `plant.js` loads that library built for wasm32 and `longwalk.js`
  hands it each planting the plot service holds. Nothing is drawn from an image
  and nothing is precomputed: a plant on this page is the plant on the phone
  because it is the same arithmetic, not because somebody kept two drawings in
  step.

  **The sky is the real one**, worked out for wherever this browser is keeping
  time and asking for nothing to find out — `sky.js`, a port of SeedCore's
  `Sky`, held to it by `tools/reference/check_sky.mjs`. Both halves of it: the
  plots float, so the stars under them are drawn too.

  **It is a night, so the page is dark whatever the reader's system says.**
  Every other page here follows `prefers-color-scheme`; this one cannot,
  because the walk is lit by its own sky and a pale page around it is a second
  room.

  `noindex`, for the reason `/g` gives: walkable and indexed are different
  properties and only one of them was asked for.

  Static, like the rest: no analytics, no font CDN, no third-party anything.
-->
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Peace Garden — the Long Walk</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A path with plots down either side, and in each one the plants two people grew when they met." />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/icon-180.png" />
  </head>

  <body class="night">
    <!--
      The walk itself, behind everything. The sky is behind the plots, and the
      pool of light sits between them so the plots stand in front of the sky
      rather than on top of a picture of one.
    -->
    <div class="walk" aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas id="sky"></canvas>
      <div class="pool"></div>
    </div>
    <canvas class="walk-stage" id="stage" aria-label="The Long Walk"></canvas>

    <main class="page walk-page" id="page">
      <header class="masthead">
        <a href="/"
          ><img class="mark" src="/assets/icon.svg" alt="" width="44" height="44"
        /></a>
        <span class="wordmark">Peace Garden</span>
      </header>

      <h1 class="heading" data-s="walkTitle"></h1>
      <p class="body walk-about" data-s="walkAbout"></p>

      <!--
        One line, and only when there is something to say: while the plants are
        being grown, or when there is nothing down there yet. It carries no
        count — a running tally of plots and plants is a readout, and this is a
        walk.
      -->
      <p class="label walk-note" id="note" role="status" hidden></p>

      <nav class="walk-keys" id="keys" role="group" hidden>
        <button class="pad-key" type="button" id="back" data-s="walkBack"></button>
        <button class="pad-key" type="button" id="left" data-s="walkLeft"></button>
        <button class="pad-key" type="button" id="right" data-s="walkRight"></button>
        <button class="pad-key" type="button" id="on" data-s="walkOn"></button>
      </nav>

      <p class="notice body">
        <a href="/privacy" data-s="privacyTitle"></a>
      </p>

      <footer class="foot">
        <label class="chooser">
          <span class="label" id="language-label"></span>
          <span class="chooser__field">
            <select id="language" class="chooser__select"></select>
            <!-- Monoline, even weight, round free ends, per BRAND.md §3.2. -->
            <svg class="chooser__mark" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path
                d="M4 6.5 L8 10.5 L12 6.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.25"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </label>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/plain.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/walkpage.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
